u","overview":"Graduation is fast approaching for 3rd-year high school student Gu Xiaoman, a sanda fighter, who wins medals in sports but not in class. Because she wants to continue to be schoolmates with her idol Zuo An, she decides to give the same effort to academics as she does to sanda. Her hard work combined with Zuo An's efforts to be her personal teacher pays off and they get into the same university."},{"language":"zh-CN","overview":"高三毕业在即，顾小满为了能与男神左岸继续做同学，拿出练习散打的精神死磕学习。自身刻苦努力加上天才学霸左岸的独家指导，顾小满达成最强逆袭，成功与男神考入同一所大学，向着爱情和学业一路高歌猛进。如果说高中生活两人之间是暗戳戳的小互动不间断，狠狠撩拨观众的少女心。那么大学生活则是依旧笑料不断，两人敞开发糖，甜度升级翻倍。都说最甜不过双向暗恋，两个初心萌动的人在靠近彼此的路上最是甜蜜有爱、百看不倦，甚至连途中的“意外”事件都显得萌趣十足。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1UTTv5kNpdqb2hLGZPZIIZxpQIR.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zkq2nP1t2LAcpLc0cAeXLyvqpkU.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2019,"episodeCount":32,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uggGjPMbp94Nctf4TXy9bWLDQUR.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/95102/season/1"}],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":95102,"type":"tv","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nIdwhoQmwLgB6gZPcPApKz5qctY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nIdwhoQmwLgB6gZPcPApKz5qctY.jpg","language":"en","width":720,"height":1080},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nIdwhoQmwLgB6gZPcPApKz5qctY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nIdwhoQmwLgB6gZPcPApKz5qctY.jpg","language":"en","width":720,"height":1080}]},"zh":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1UTTv5kNpdqb2hLGZPZIIZxpQIR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/